Target voice diagnostic backend

TargetVoiceInference.cpp ports the streaming state/overlap-add algorithm from
VoxLock core.py. It is a modified C++ implementation with fixed 40 ms chunks,
preallocated external tensor storage, independent reusable enrollment, bounded
error strings and a final flush trimmed to the valid input length.

